.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-repo-create \- Create a new GitLab project/repository.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab repo create [path] [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Creates the new project with your first configured host in your \fBglab\fR
configuration. The host defaults to \fBGitLab.com\fR if not set. To set a host,
provide either:
.IP \(bu 2
A \fBGITLAB_HOST\fR environment variable.
.IP \(bu 2
A full URL for the project.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--defaultBranch\fP=""
	Branch name for the new project, overriding both the GitLab instance default and your local git configuration.

.PP
\fB-d\fP, \fB--description\fP=""
	Description of the new project. Set to "-" to open an editor.

.PP
\fB-g\fP, \fB--group\fP=""
	Namespace or group for the new project. Defaults to the current user's namespace.

.PP
\fB--internal\fP[=false]
	Make project internal: visible to any authenticated user. Default.

.PP
\fB-n\fP, \fB--name\fP=""
	Name of the new project.

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--private\fP[=false]
	Make project private: visible only to project members.

.PP
\fB-P\fP, \fB--public\fP[=false]
	Make project public: visible without any authentication.

.PP
\fB--readme\fP[=false]
	Initialize project with \fBREADME.md\fR\&. The repository is cloned locally after creation to ensure the local branch matches the remote.

.PP
\fB--remoteName\fP="origin"
	Remote name for the Git repository you're in. Defaults to \fBorigin\fR if not provided.

.PP
\fB-s\fP, \fB--skipGitInit\fP[=false]
	Skip local repository setup (skips both 'git init' and cloning).

.PP
\fB-t\fP, \fB--tag\fP=[]
	The list of tags for the project.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Create a repository under your account using the current directory name.
glab repo create

# Create a repository under a group using the current directory name.
glab repo create --group glab-cli

# Create a repository with a specific name.
glab repo create my-project

# Create a repository for a group.
glab repo create glab-cli/my-project

# Create on a host other than gitlab.com.
GITLAB_HOST=example.com glab repo create
glab repo create <host>/path/to/repository
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-repo(1)\fP
